  "description": "Foundation library for HTTP-API wrappers in Tamp. TampApiClient base class handles HttpClient construction, Basic/Bearer/CustomHeader auth with Secret-redacted credentials, JSON serialization, and typed error mapping. Used by Tamp.AdoRest.V7 (TAM-97) and upcoming wrappers for GitHub issues, YouTrack, Jira, and similar HTTP APIs. No V-pin — library shape is intended to be stable.",
